      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PostgreSQL 19 用 GRAPH_TABLE 支持 SQL/PGQ",
      "summary": "SQL/PGQ 是 2023 年进入 SQL 标准的图查询语法。Christophe Pettus 介绍了 PostgreSQL 19 落地的 GRAPH_TABLE：先用 CREATE PROPERTY GRAPH 把已有表声明成点表和边表，再用 MATCH 写模式，实现上重写成关系连接交给现有优化器，而不是新做一套图存储。当前不支持变长遍历，深度遍历也追不上 Neo4j 的免索引邻接，作者认为浅层图查询可以留在库里做。",
      "url": "https://thebuild.com/blog/sqlpgq-in-postgresql-19-graph-queries-without-the-graph-database/",
      "author": "Christophe Pettus",
      "source": "thebuild.com",
      "source_date": "2026-06-01",
      "image": "https://thebuild.com/media/media/38d05657106745939380b9151dbb8e88.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "PostgreSQL 19",
